<view class="prebuilt-page"><image class="prebuilt-bg" src="/images/runtime/team-data-emerald-stadium-v1.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="prebuilt-content"><view class="prebuilt-nav"><text class="prebuilt-back" bindtap="back">‹</text><text>接收参赛队伍</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="prebuilt-loading">正在核验邀请…</view><view wx:elif="{{errorText}}" class="prebuilt-error">{{errorText}}</view><block wx:else><view class="prebuilt-tournament"><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-02.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>{{tournament.name}}</text><text>{{invite.divisionName}}</text></view></view><text class="prebuilt-heading">主办方预设参赛信息</text><view class="prebuilt-team"><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v1-tab-team.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>{{prebuiltTeam.name}}</text><text>负责人：{{invite.managerName}} {{invite.managerPhoneMasked}}</text></view><text>待接收</text></view><text class="prebuilt-explain">主办方已为你预建本届赛事队伍，请确认数据归属。</text><text class="prebuilt-heading">确认接收方式</text><view wx:if="{{hasCandidate}}" class="prebuilt-option prebuilt-recommended"><text class="prebuilt-mark">推荐</text><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-11.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>使用我的现有球队参赛</text><text>保留球员和球队历史，只绑定本届赛事关系</text></view><view wx:for="{{candidateTeams}}" wx:key="id" class="{{item.className || 'candidate'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-name="{{item.name}}" bindtap="chooseExisting"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.playerCount}} 名球员</text></view><button bindtap="acceptExisting" disabled="{{acceptDisabled}}">{{existingActionLabel}}</button></view><view class="prebuilt-option"><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-12.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>接收主办方预建队伍</text><text>适合这是一个新球队；接收后成为你的长期球队</text></view><button bindtap="acceptPrebuilt" disabled="{{acceptDisabled}}">接收预建队伍</button></view><view class="prebuilt-disclaimer" bindtap="toggleDisclaimer"><view class="prebuilt-checkbox {{disclaimerCheckboxClass}}"><text wx:if="{{disclaimerAgreed}}">✓</text></view><view><text>我已阅读并同意参赛免责声明</text><text>确认后提交本届赛事资格审核，并保留线上确认记录</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{reviewRequired}}" class="prebuilt-review-action"><text>当前邀请存在归属冲突，需要先提交证明材料并等待主办方核验。</text><button bindtap="openClaimConflict">去提交人工审核</button></view><view class="prebuilt-warning"><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-13.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>系统不会自动合并两支球队；名称、负责人或归属冲突时进入人工核验。</text></view><view class="prebuilt-flow"><text>1 确认数据归属</text><text>→</text><text>2 确认参赛</text><text>→</text><text>3 提交审核</text></view></block></view></view>
